<Position>24.000000,56.000000,0.000000</Position>
<Text>&lt;font color="#000000" size=11&gt;

These demonstration pages will take you through some of the most commonly used controls in XuiTool.
To run this demo, press the F5 key or click the 'File &gt; Preview' menu option.
Do this now...

&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font size=8&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;
&lt;td width="86%" bgcolor="#808080"&gt;

&lt;font size=5&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;font color="#FFFFFF" size=10&gt;
To navigate through the controls/pages, you can use any of the following:

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The arrow keys on your keyboard, along with the A/B/X/Y keys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The mouse cursor, and the left mouse button&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An Xbox 360 controller connected to your PC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;font size=8&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

All controls can be skinned using &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visuals&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; from a skin file.
For instance, this is how you would create two &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Button&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; controls that look completely different from one another.
If the &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; property isn't specified for a control, it will use a &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; with the same name as the control's class (ie. &lt;i&gt;XuiButton&lt;/i&gt;).
To see the &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visuals&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; being used in this demonstration, run the 'File &gt; Open' menu option and select the &lt;i&gt;skin_default.xui&lt;/i&gt; file.
&lt;/font&gt;

</Text>
</Properties>
</XuiHtmlElement>
